WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:01.600
Astral!

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:08.710
ZEXAL...

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:11.710
Astral, wha-what’s happening to you?!

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:22.370
Thi... This is...

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:24.800
Right...

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:28.710
Astral and I were absorbed and thrown here together.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.080
Then...

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:33.450
Wh-What is...?!

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:36.140
Astral?!

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:40.680
Could it be... this is the inside of Astral's heart?

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:44.740
Astral!

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:56.000
So this is ZEXAL.

00:00:56.480 --> 00:01:00.220
Seems like you were completely devoured by evil, huh?

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:03.570
<i>Astral... I...</i>

00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:06.280
<i>There are so many things I have to apologize for.</i>

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:10.020
<i>Therefore... Therefore...</i>

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:14.020
Yuma, you have betrayed me.

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:17.970
You lied to me, and stomped on my trust towards you.

00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:28.320
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:34.290
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:37.000
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:49.350
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:52.430
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:56.940
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:01:56.940 --> 00:01:59.310
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:02.530
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:07.070
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:09.200
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:11.910
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:14.370
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:17.420
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:19.880
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:25.920
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:28.680
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:30.140
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:34.850
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:43.900
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:58.570
Even the cards I draw are dyed with the power of evil!

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:02.950
Dark Draw!

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:08.410
"Break Through the Limit!!
 'Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray Victory'!

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:06.700
So now it turns into a <i>Dark Draw</i>?

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:10.160
I Summon Dark ZEXAL Weapon - Chimera Cloth.

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.130
I activate Chimera Cloth’s effect.

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:24.300
This card destroys one Magic or Trap Card on the field.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:29.100
Then, since the card was destroyed,

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:32.520
I equip Chimera Cloth to Hope Ray V!

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:38.570
Though Hope Ray V, when equipped Chimera Cloth, will lose its Monster Effects,

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:41.030
he cannot be destroyed by battle!

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:46.870
Hope Ray V, attack Shining!

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:54.750
Are you crazy?!

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:57.250
Shining’s the one who has higher Attack Power!

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:01.300
Even if Hope Ray V won't be destroyed,
you'll receive the damage anyway!

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:06.760
Chimera Cloth's effect activates.

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:10.390
When the equipped Monster receives damage during a battle,

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:14.350
it doubles its Attack Power and allows it to attack once again!

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:16.360
Dark Charge!

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:17.980
Say what?!

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:21.070
Hope Ray V attacks Shining!

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:25.660
Trap, activate! Hundred Over!

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:29.040
With this card, when my Monster was attacked,

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:30.830
its destruction is negated!

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:40.510
In return, this turn, the attacking Monster

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:42.300
can attack once <i>again</i>!

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:45.470
Hope Ray V attacks Shining!

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:48.720
I activate another effect of Hundred Over!

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:52.310
When the targeted Monster of this trap was attacked,

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:56.650
its Attack Power will be the opponent's
 Monster's Attack Points plus 100!

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:07.240
Chimera Cloth's effect activates!

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.910
It doubles the Monster’s Attack Power,

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:12.080
and it can attack once again!

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.250
Dark Charge!

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:16.420
Hope Ray V attacks Shining!

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.130
Oh? <i>Meo</i>what?

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:21.960
Due to Hundred Over’s effect, Shining’s Attack Power will be

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:25.550
always 100 higher than Hope Ray V’s!

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:28.760
Even if it attacks, he would just receive the damage, or not!

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:34.350
I activate the effect of Hundred Over!

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:38.770
Its Attack Power becomes the same as my opponent's Monster’s, plus 100 Attack Points!

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:43.440
Looks like you snapped.

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:45.820
If I leave you like this now...

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:50.410
Yuma, you are evil.

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:52.950
You betrayed me...

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:54.790
The doubt and anger inside me...

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:56.250
The sorrow...

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.670
You are the evil who brought it to me.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:07.550
Chimera Cloth's effect activates!
Dark Charge!

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:10.720
Hope Ray V attacks Shining!

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:16.730
I can't believe in you anymore.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:22.150
Wouldn't you say things are getting bad, or not?

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:24.610
If this goes on, he'll reduce his Life to 500...

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:28.150
To summarize, ZEXAL would lose due to Sargasso's effect!

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.870
Please come to your senses!

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:41.380
Astral!

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:45.500
Yuma, what did you come for?

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:50.010
What for...? Because I thought I'd apologize to you...

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:52.550
Apologize? What for?

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:53.510
Huh?

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:57.310
You certainly have betrayed me.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:01.480
and I lost the feelings of trust I had for you.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:06.980
But in exchange, I have obtained a new power.

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:10.450
The <i>evil</i>, Yuma.

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:18.580
I didn't know! That evil... and hatred... had such a strong power.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:21.040
Dark Charge!

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:26.920
Hope Ray V attacks Shining!

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:35.600
Please stop!

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:38.470
One more attack and it’s over, or not!

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:41.020
I know...

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:44.520
I know, now that I've been filled with the power!

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:49.320
I want more! Much more of hatred, of rage, of distrust!

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:53.610
When they fill me up, I will get even stronger!

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:58.330
Astral... it's my fault... all because of me...!

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:01.540
Yuma, I thank you very much!

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:06.420
The one who brought this power to me... is you!

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:12.840
And when I am filled up with hatred, I will be given the power to destroy everything!

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:18.220
Black... Blacken me! All of me!

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.470
Stop it!

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:29.360
ASTRAL!

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:37.320
Dark Charge!

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:39.240
That's good, just attack me!

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:42.410
And that'll be the <i>end of you</i>!

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:56.760
What's that?!

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:07.980
Yuma, Astral!

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:12.440
Yuma...

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:18.280
Astral!

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:21.540
Yuma! Stop the attack of Hope Ray V!

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:23.700
If you don't, you'll lose!

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:29.630
I end my turn with this!

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:36.550
Oh well... but you still have to take Sargasso’s effect!

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:38.970
Astral!

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:50.900
Your Life is a mere 100 <i>and</i> you have only one card in your deck left.

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:54.490
On top of that, the parter you've been relying on is in <i>such a mess</i>!

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:56.990
You should just <i>give up</i> already!

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:01.620
No! I won't give up!

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:06.500
Astral and the guys are so important to me, so...

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.130
I won't let you hurt them any longer!

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:11.130
Yuma...

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:15.420
My turn! Draw!

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:18.930
Let me show you my true power!

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:22.560
I activate the Rank-Up Magic, Barian’s Force!

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:26.180
This card will Rank-Up an Xyz Monster,

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:28.810
and Special Summon a Chaos Xyz!

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:33.320
I Overlay the Rank Four Masquerade Magician - Shining!

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:37.280
With this one Monster, I rebuild the Overlay Network!

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:40.110
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:47.080
Appear, Chaos Number 104!

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:52.500
Born from chaos, when the power of Barian overrides the light,

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.800
the Great Darkness will dance!

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:57.920
Masquerade Magician Umbral!

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:03.260
That's Vector's Chaos Number!

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:07.890
<i>Yuma... Your bond with me was severed...</i>

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:10.810
<i>How can you go on fighting alone?</i>

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:16.730
When a Chaos Xyz is Special Summoned by Barian’s Force,

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:21.320
it absorbs all Overlay Units from my opponent’s Xyz Monster!

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:27.240
Then, for every Overlay Unit it took away,

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:30.870
your Monster loses 300 Attack Points!

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:34.380
I'm not done yet! When Umbral was Special Summoned,

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:38.920
it destroys one card in the Magic/Trap Zone on my opponent’s field!

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:44.010
I destroy Chimera Cloth!
Destroy Step!

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:48.470
Chimera Cloth was...!

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:51.980
Now that your Equip Magic was broken,

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:56.650
both the Attack Power and Life you gain go <i>poof</i>!

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:57.900
It’s over now!

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:01.030
Umbral, attack Hope Ray V!

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:05.030
Yuma!

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:10.500
Trap, activate! Xyz Revenge Shuffle!

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:14.960
With this card, when my Monster was destroyed by battle,

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:17.000
it makes the damage zero,

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:20.510
and the destroyed Xyz Monster goes back to the Extra Deck!

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:26.100
Then, by allowing the opposing Monster to attack once again,

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:31.100
I Special Summon one Xyz Monster
 from my Graveyard in Attack Position!

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:34.270
Revive, Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:36.980
Are you an idiot?

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:41.110
If you Summon an Xyz Monster and take damage due to Sargasso’s effe-

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:44.200
I activate Preventomato’s Monster Effect from my Graveyard!

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:51.120
By Banishing this card, all Effect Damage during my opponent's turn is negated!

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:54.420
Guess that's the disadvantage of Deck Destruction.

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:57.330
Somehow he managed to just save himself...

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:58.880
It's hopeless, or not!

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:01.840
But Yuma is fighting on desperately.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:05.550
He wants to protect Astral and he's trying all on his own!

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:10.560
Then I use Xyz Revenge Shuffle’s effect to attack Hope once again!

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:14.270
<i>If I only had an Overlay Unit... Right!</i>

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:18.440
I activate Magic Recycler’s Monster Effect from my Graveyard!

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:22.900
By Banishing this card, I send one card from my deck to the Graveyard,

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:27.700
and return the Magic Card at the bottom of my Graveyard to my deck!

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:32.040
<i>I'm sure that card hasn't been sent to the Graveyard back then.</i>

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:37.420
<i>Then it has to be the last card in my deck... </i>

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:39.420
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:42.760
Due to the effect, I send one card to the Graveyard,

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:45.300
and put the Magic Card from my Graveyard into the deck!

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:48.680
What’s the point in doing that?

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:51.010
Go, Umbral!

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:57.100
I activate Xyz Agent’s Monster Effect which I sent to the Graveyard!

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:00.900
By Banishing Xyz Agent,

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:06.070
I can activate the effect of one Xyz Monster that requires using Overlay Units!

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:12.740
Hope! Moon Barrier!

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:20.210
He seems to have dodged this one,
but he has only gained a bit of time.

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:25.590
And regardless, you still believe he will win?

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:27.840
Yeah. I believe it.

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:29.180
Why?

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:32.810
Because I <i>want</i> to trust in him. That’s why I believe in him!

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:35.560
That's what trust is all about, right?!

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:37.640
Trust...?

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:43.730
You just don't know when to quit! Then I activate Umbral’s effect!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:49.240
By detaching one Chaos Overlay Unit, one card of the opponent's hand is sent to the Graveyard,

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:51.160
and his Life is halved!

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:54.450
I detach two Chaos Overlay Units!

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:57.250
Take this! Dark Blunder!

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:05.750
Then two cards from your hand go to the Graveyard!

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:10.220
How's that? Your Life is 25 and you have one card left in your deck.

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:14.470
You got no hand and no set cards either. 
One could say you're in a bit of a <i>fix</i> here!

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:20.640
That damn Vector...

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:22.810
Where are you looking?

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:26.360
You... don't you care about <i>your</i> friend?

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:28.320
It's not that I don't care.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:33.490
I just believe in Yuma Tsukumo as a Duelist, is all!

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:38.700
<i>I will give him the final blow with this card.</i>

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:43.920
<i>His final card is Barian’s Force! That will be his end!</i>

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:47.250
I set one card and end my turn!

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:49.550
What's the matter?

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:53.470
Going by that look, you can't even draw, eh?!

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:58.470
Although the bonds with your partner have been that tragically buried, you still gonna go?

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:03.810
Vector, the bonds between Astral and me may have indeed been buried by you.

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.650
But I know this!

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:08.900
Even though they have been sent to the Graveyard by your dirty tricks,

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:11.570
as long as I believe in the power of
 my feelings that lie stacked there,

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:15.910
a card by the name of Hope will be there to help me!

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:20.870
Ha! Isn't that some nice talk?

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:26.340
But your last remaining hope is resting on <i>that</i> card!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:29.510
The proof of friendship between you and Shingetsu!

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:31.760
He's right...

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:35.970
But now, all I can do is draw this card...

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:38.560
... and believe in the hope of this last draw.

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:40.640
My turn! Draw!

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:49.440
Yuma!

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:51.440
Yuma...

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.450
Astral...

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:55.410
Yuma...

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:59.790
I can no longer believe in you as I did before.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:07.250
But, like you, I want to believe in hope
and fight on, despite all the hardships...

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:08.880
I too want to believe.

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:12.050
Yuma...
Astral...

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:14.470
I will...

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:15.510
...along with me...

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:17.680
We'll bring it to 'im!

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:25.390
They're heart to heart, shining with hope...

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:28.810
The strong bond that connects two of them shall call a miracle!

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:31.280
Bastards...

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:33.860
Let’s go, Yuma!

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:34.650
Yeah!

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.280
With myself!

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:37.110
And me!

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:38.450
We Overlay!

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:45.160
We build the Overlay Network with the two of us!

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:51.170
When our two hearts connected by a true bond reunite,

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:53.880
the legendary miracle shall appear!

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:02.850
Xyz Change! ZEXAL!

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:11.770
A new ZEXAL, you say?

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:16.450
But even if you evolve <i>now</i>, it's <i>far too late</i>!

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.570
Is that so?

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:19.240
What?!

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:24.870
Passionate feelings reunited will rebuild hope
for the future of this world!

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:27.410
Re-Contract Universe!

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:34.130
What?! You actually modified the card?!

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:36.300
The light of miracle repels the darkness,

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:39.930
and calls out the true appearance of Limited Barian’s Force!

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:43.350
I activate Rank-up Magic, Numeron Force!

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:47.680
This card will rank-up my Xyz Monster,

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:50.480
and Special Summon a Chaos Xyz!

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:54.940
I rebuild the Overlay Network with the Rank Four Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:57.690
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:01.530
Appear, Chaos Number 39!

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.950
Grasp Victory in the shining future!

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:09.330
Clustering feelings, connected by our hearts, will change the world!

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:16.090
Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray Victory!

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:23.510
Hope Ray Victory, you said?!

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:28.310
But due to Sargasso’s effect, you're finished!

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:31.520
When Numeron Force is activated,

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:36.650
the effects of all face-up cards on the field are negated!

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:38.820
What?!

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:42.700
Here I come! Hope Ray Victory, attack Umbral!

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:47.120
At this moment, I activate Hope Ray Victory’s Monster Effect!

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:51.710
By detaching one Overlay Unit, when this Monster battles,

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:56.130
the Attack Power of the opposing Monster is added to its own Attack Power!

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:57.800
Victory Charge!

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:01.550
5800?!

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:04.300
This is the... power of our bond!

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:07.180
Go, Hope Ray Victory!

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:11.060
Crush Umbral and Vector!

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:17.730
Hope Sword Double Victory Slash!

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:45.010
He did it! 
He did it!

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:46.720
You did it, Yuma!

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:47.930
A huge reversal!

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:49.930
Man, that was a thriller.

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:54.190
Just what... is happening?!

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:56.270
That's bad! The Sargasso...

00:20:58.150 --> 00:20:59.440
Misael, retreat!

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:00.110
Durbe!

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:03.610
It seems the energy of light that the new ZEXAL brought about

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:06.240
has disrupted the balance of Sargasso.

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:07.030
But...!

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:09.950
Do you want to be swallowed by the gap between the different dimensions?

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:11.950
Kaito.

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:16.250
Don’t think you bastards have won this...!

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:21.920
Listen well! The evil stain that contaminated the heart of Astral will not disappear!

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:24.800
That feeling of the stain will last forever!

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:28.010
It will slowly corrode your bond!

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:58.420
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:21:58.790 --> 00:22:06.050
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:13.640
<i>Do you laugh at your dreams, saying "impossible"?</i>

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:20.980
<i>You must find it funny that I'm not able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:37.960
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:22:37.960 --> 00:22:42.710
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:53.100
<i>As long as I live, you'll always be my tiny, little friend</i>

00:22:53.100 --> 00:23:01.650
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:01.650 --> 00:23:06.400
<i>Because I want to become an artist</i>

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:12.700
<i>Look, I like doing it 'cuz it's fun.</i>

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:19.370
Astral...

00:23:19.870 --> 00:23:21.630
We won, right?

00:23:22.210 --> 00:23:23.080
Yes.

00:23:23.630 --> 00:23:27.510
But our battle has just begun.

00:23:28.380 --> 00:23:32.340
I know... I... will become stronger!

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:34.010
I definitely will!

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:37.100
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:23:41.520 --> 00:23:45.610
Soon after the death match with the Barians, we were gathered again in the airship.

00:23:45.900 --> 00:23:50.200
Over there is a message from my dad and a map that marks seven locations!

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:52.910
Seven Numbers located in the ruins...

00:23:52.910 --> 00:23:54.570
That guy is not a Barian!

00:23:54.570 --> 00:23:56.490
That’s the spirit of a Number?

00:23:56.490 --> 00:23:59.540
Shark, I will definitely save you!

00:23:59.870 --> 00:24:01.920
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:05.340
"Restart the Airship! Aim for the Legendary Numbers!"

00:24:05.340 --> 00:24:08.420
Are we being tested by something?
